@page "/"

<PageTitle>SmartX Home</PageTitle>

<div class="container py-4">

    <div class="p-4 mb-4 bg-dark text-white rounded-4 shadow">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-8">
                <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-2">
                    SmartX IoT Ecosystem
                </h1>

                <p class="lead mb-3">
                    A simulated Internet of Things platform for monitoring,
                    validating and managing distributed smart devices.
                </p>

                <p class="mb-0">
                    Built for PROG7312 3B - Portfolio of Evidence.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4 text-md-end mt-3 mt-md-0">
                <div class="bg-white text-dark p-3 rounded-3">
                    <strong>Student</strong>
                    <div>Sive Sikutshwa</div>

                    <strong class="d-block mt-2">Student Number</strong>
                    <div>ST10061605</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mb-4">
        <h2 class="fw-bold">SmartX Control Centre</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">
            Select a module below to access the SmartX ecosystem.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-success">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-success">ACTIVE</span>
                    </div>

                    <h4 class="card-title">
                        Sensor Data Ingestion and Telemetry
                    </h4>

                    <p class="card-text">
                        Register SmartX IoT devices, monitor sensor telemetry,
                        validate incoming data and manage simulated ESP32 nodes.
                    </p>

                    <a href="/telemetry"
                       class="btn btn-success">
                        Open Telemetry Module
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-success">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-success">
                            ACTIVE · PART 2
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <h4 class="card-title">
                        Real-Time Command Stream and History
                    </h4>

                    <p class="card-text">
                        Process live telemetry queues, manage device commands,
                        prioritise critical alerts and track command history.
                    </p>

                    <a href="/command-stream" class="btn btn-success">
                        Open Command Stream
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-success">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <span class="badge bg-success">
                            ACTIVE · PART 3
                        </span>
                    </div>

                    <h4 class="card-title">
                        Network Topology and Mesh Routing
                    </h4>

                    <p class="card-text">
                        Visualise the SmartX mesh network, inspect connected
                        nodes and calculate efficient routing paths.
                    </p>

                    <a href="/network-topology" class="btn btn-success">
                        Open Network Topology
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="row g-4 mt-4">

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5>Multi-Type Telemetry</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        SmartX supports temperature, soil moisture,
                        power consumption and actuator state data.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5>IoT Device Simulation</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        Simulated ESP32 devices allow SmartX to demonstrate
                        high-volume IoT behaviour without physical hardware.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-4">
            <div class="card border-0 bg-light h-100">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h5>Advanced C# Concepts</h5>
                    <p class="mb-0">
                        The system demonstrates generics, collections,
                        operator overloading, advanced arrays and recursion.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-5 p-4 rounded-4 bg-light border">
        <h3>About SmartX</h3>

        <p>
            SmartX is designed to simulate a distributed IoT environment
            consisting of environmental sensors, power monitoring devices
            and smart actuators.
        </p>

        <p class="mb-0">
            Part 1 focuses on the ingestion and validation layer, where
            devices are registered and telemetry is received through the
            SmartX .NET Web API.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>
